  "html": "\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"80\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr:80/skill/Image/skill_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"500\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:80/500\" usemap=\"#skill_1\" width=\"80\"></font></p></td>\n<td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"670\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr:80/skill/Image/t_wre.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"28\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:142/28\" width=\"142\"></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp; </font>\n</p><table border=\"\" bordercolor=\"silver\" bordercolordark=\"silver\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"28\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"top\" colspan=\"4\" height=\"28\" width=\"550\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">레스링이 높을수록 물리적으로 \n                        맞는 확률이 적어집니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">그러므로 마법 구동시 물리적 \n                        공격에 의한 간섭을 줄일 수 있으므로</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">마법위주로 플레이하시는 경우는 \n                        필요 스킬이 됩니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">마법 공격은 간섭을 줄이지 못함을 \n                        상기하시길.</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"heading\" height=\"28\" width=\"550\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">Weapon Name</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"heading\" height=\"28\" width=\"169\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">Damage</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"heading\" height=\"28\" width=\"550\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">Speed</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"heading\" height=\"28\" width=\"186\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">Skill</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"550\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">Bare Fists(레스링)</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"28\" width=\"169\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">1-8</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"28\" width=\"550\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">?</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"28\" width=\"182\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">1-100</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp; \n            \n            </p><table border=\"\" bordercolor=\"silver\" bordercolordark=\"silver\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"28\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"top\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"28\" width=\"545\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">레스링의 특수공격</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"heading\" height=\"28\" width=\"137\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">특수공격</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"heading\" height=\"28\" width=\"406\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">설명</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"137\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">Disarm</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"28\" width=\"406\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">레스링80+아나토미80이상일 때 \n                        적의 무기나 마법책을</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">랜덤하게 백팩으로 떨어뜨릴수 \n                        있습니다</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"137\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">Stun&nbsp;Punch</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"28\" width=\"406\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">레스링80+아나토미80이상일 때 \n                        랜덤하게</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">스턴펀치를 날려 적을 5초간 얼리게 \n                        합니다.</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;이표는 </font><a href=\"http://uo.stratics.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><b>UOSS</b></font></a><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">에서 나온표입니다.</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"74\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"676\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p><map name=\"skill_1\">\n<area coords=\"0, 32, 80, 44\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128220500/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/ar.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 46, 79, 58\" href=\"/site/skill/mac/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 60, 79, 73\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128220500/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/sw.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 75, 79, 90\" href=\"/site/skill/fe/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 92, 78, 106\" href=\"/site/skill/wr/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 108, 77, 120\" href=\"/site/skill/an/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 122, 79, 135\" href=\"/site/skill/he/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 182, 79, 196\" href=\"/site/skill/ma/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 198, 79, 211\" href=\"/site/skill/mad/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 213, 79, 226\" href=\"/site/skill/re/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 286, 79, 301\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128220500/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/ta.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 303, 79, 315\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128220500/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/bl.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 317, 79, 330\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128220500/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/mi.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 332, 79, 346\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128220500/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/ca.htm\" shape=\"r